# Separate projects that consume this library, kept out of this repository.
site
app

# The site is here rather than out: GitHub Pages builds it from this repository,
# and keeping it alongside the player is what makes the version it advertises
# checkable against the version being shipped. Its own .gitignore covers
# everything scripts/sync-player.mjs copies in.

# Claude Code configuration is per-developer and lives in ~/.claude at user
# scope. Nothing about how the repository is edited belongs in the repository.
.claude/
